'''Idi:Re''' (イディ:Re, '''''Idi:Re''''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy found in the [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Eldritch Forces Invasion]] which appears after clearing all [[Stories of Legend]] sub-chapters on 4-Crown difficulty. Completing the stage will unlock Idi:Re's [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] counterpart, [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]]. She was added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Idi:Re
|image = E 526.png
|appearance = '''SoL''': [[Eldritch Forces/Invasion|Sub-chapter 49 - Eldritch Forces Invasion]]
|money drop = 9,000¢ - 35,550¢
}}

==Enemy==
She has extreme health, damage and movement speed, with [[Omni Strike]] attacks that extend past her surprisingly short standing range. Her attack power doubles at 50% HP, though she could already OHKO most units even pre-strengthen, so you can use the strengthen as an indicator to see how close she is to death. She has 33 knockbacks and a long backswing which makes her reasonably easy to stall when by herself, but once a peon gets in the way, she's sure to move forward. Because of her high movement speed, close range and instant retaliation after a knockback, she will often be uncomfortably close to the [[Cat Base]]. However, the main difficulty of her stage comes from the peons and 4-Crown restrictions found within it.

Despite appearing to levitate, she's not a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy, as stated in her description.

